Limitations:
  Actual filenames and audio tags are not rewritten; filenames are suggestions.
  No audio fingerprinting or recording transcription is performed.
  Default comments are licensed CritiqueBrainz reviews, not private platform APIs.
  Album reviews stay labelled as album reviews. Missing comments are never invented.
  Source permissions, provider availability and content licenses remain applicable.
  No external AI service, paid account or personal Telegram/NAS credentials were used.
